Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.58,0:00:04.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, hey, Joey. - Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.58,0:00:04.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喔，嘿，乔伊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.21,0:00:08.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey. - Listen, I need to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.21,0:00:08.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你好 - 听着，我有件事要问你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.25,0:00:10.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know how my stepdad's in prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.25,0:00:10.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道我继父在坐牢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:12.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:12.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 知道 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.55,0:00:16.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He was supposed to get a weekend furlough so he could go to the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.55,0:00:16.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}本来周末他可以放假 来参加明天的婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.76,0:00:18.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But he just called and...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.76,0:00:18.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是他刚刚打电话来…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.10,0:00:24.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, apparently stabbing Iceman in the exercise yard couldn't wait till Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.10,0:00:24.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看来刺杀其他犯人的活动 不能等到星期一才办
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:26.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- So he can't come? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:26.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 所以他不能来？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.73,0:00:29.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And so there's no one to walk me down the aisle. And...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.73,0:00:29.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以没有人陪我走过走道，然后…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.73,0:00:33.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I would just really love it if you would do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.73,0:00:33.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你能陪我，我会很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.74,0:00:36.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Seriously? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.74,0:00:36.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你说真的？ - 当然
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.49,0:00:39.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You've, you know, sort of been like a dad to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.49,0:00:39.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你待我就跟父亲一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.79,0:00:44.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You've always, you know, looked out for me and shared your wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.79,0:00:44.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说，你一直很照顾我 也常和我分享生活智慧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:49.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am pretty "wisdomous."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:49.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的确很有〝雅慧〞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:52.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:52.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你愿意吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.13,0:00:56.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you kidding? Phoebe, I would be honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.13,0:00:56.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你开玩笑吗？菲比，这是我的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.59,0:00:59.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PHOEBE: Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.59,0:00:59.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.26,0:01:02.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hope...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.26,0:01:02.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我希望…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.73,0:01:06.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hope you know how much you mean to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.73,0:01:06.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我希望你了解 你对我有多重要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.94,0:01:09.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen, I hope...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.94,0:01:09.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着，我也希望…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.31,0:01:11.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hope that you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.31,0:01:11.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也希望你知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:17.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't want you to see your father cry. Go to your room!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:17.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不能让你看见老爸哭，回房间去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:21.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friends S10E12 The One With Phoebe's Wedding
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:21.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》  第十季  第12集  菲比的婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.09,0:01:33.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}主演：珍妮佛安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.96,0:01:37.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}主演：寇妮考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.72,0:01:41.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}主演：丽莎库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.89,0:01:48.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}主演：麦特勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.73,0:01:52.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}主演：马修派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.57,0:01:56.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}主演：大卫修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.79,0:02:11.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh. - Oh, no, no, no. Let your dad get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.79,0:02:11.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不必了…老爸请客
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.71,0:02:14.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CELL PHONE RINGING]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:19.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. It's my wedding planner. She's driving me crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:19.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又是我的婚礼策划人 她快把我搞疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.88,0:02:24.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello? Okay, stop screaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.88,0:02:24.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喂？不要尖叫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.76,0:02:27.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, so halibut.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.76,0:02:27.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，那就比目鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.56,0:02:30.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, so salmon. Either way. I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.56,0:02:30.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，那就换鲑鱼 随便，我不知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:33.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- It doesn't matter to me. - Well, it matters to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:33.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我不在乎 - 可是我在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.28,0:02:38.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I don't care. So you pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.28,0:02:38.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不在乎，你选就好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.40,0:02:40.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you just hang up on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.40,0:02:40.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你刚刚挂我电话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.49,0:02:45.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}制片：罗勃卡洛克
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.01,0:02:44.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, look, I need you at the rehearsal dinner tonight at 1800 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.01,0:02:44.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着，我要你在1800时 到晚餐预演
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.29,0:02:47.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. What time is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.29,0:02:47.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好…那是几点？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.91,0:02:50.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}制片：温蒂诺勒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:50.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't know military time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:50.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你听不懂军事时间代码？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.75,0:02:53.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I must have been in missile training the day they taught that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.75,0:02:53.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那天我正好在接受导弹训练
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.04,0:02:56.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}编剧：罗勃卡洛克 丹娜克莱恩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.25,0:02:56.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just subtract 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.25,0:02:56.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}减掉12
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:02:59.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, so 1800 minus 12...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:02:59.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，1800减12…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.63,0:03:02.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}导演：凯文布莱特
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.80,0:03:01.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is 1788.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.80,0:03:01.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是1788
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.26,0:03:03.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Six o'clock! - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.26,0:03:03.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 六点 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.47,0:03:04.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CELL PHONE RINGING]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.68,0:03:06.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hold on. Yeah? Geller here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.68,0:03:06.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等…我是盖勒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.72,0:03:11.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I said it has to be there by 4:00. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.72,0:03:11.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，我说四点就要送达，再见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.35,0:03:13.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How hard is it to make an ice sculpture?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.35,0:03:13.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}做个冰雕是有多难？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.86,0:03:15.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That sounds really fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.86,0:03:15.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}冰雕？这样太隆重了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.65,0:03:18.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I told you, I just want a simple wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.65,0:03:18.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说只要简单的婚礼就好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.19,0:03:20.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please, honey, leave the details to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.19,0:03:20.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托，甜心，细节交给我就好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.07,0:03:23.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, I wanna make this day as special for you as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.07,0:03:23.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会竭尽所能让你成到宾至如归
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.95,0:03:26.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was thinking the harpist should wear white.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.95,0:03:26.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想让竖琴师穿白色
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:29.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Harpist? My friend Marjorie is playing the steel drums.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:29.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}竖琴师？我朋友玛洁莉 不是要打钢鼓？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.79,0:03:32.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, she backed out. - She did? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.79,0:03:32.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 她退出了 - 真的？为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.79,0:03:34.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I made her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.79,0:03:34.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我逼她的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.79,0:03:37.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Steel drums don't really say "elegant wedding."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.79,0:03:37.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钢鼓并不适合典雅的婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.21,0:03:40.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Nor does Marjorie's overwhelming scent. - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.21,0:03:40.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 还有玛洁莉浓郁的体味 - 听好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.80,0:03:43.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She will shower when Tibet is free.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.80,0:03:43.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等西藏独立后，她自然会洗澡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.14,0:03:56.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CHANDLER: Hey. You look great. PHOEBE: You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.14,0:03:56.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嘿，你看起来真美 - 你也不错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.44,0:04:01.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm glad we're having a rehearsal dinner. I rarely practice my meals before I eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.44,0:04:01.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很高兴能来晚餐彩排 很少有机会用赛前先试吃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.32,0:04:04.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What did we say was your one gift to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.32,0:04:04.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你忘记你要送我们的礼物了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.82,0:04:08.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No stupid jokes, but I thought that was for the actual wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.82,0:04:08.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不说冷笑话 可是不是要等正式婚礼再说？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.53,0:04:10.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rehearse it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.53,0:04:10.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}先彩排
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.83,0:04:12.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.83,0:04:12.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.62,0:04:14.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Thanks for coming, you guys. - Oh, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.62,0:04:14.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 谢谢你们来 - 对…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.04,0:04:18.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was... I was going for a handshake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.04,0:04:18.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我本来…要跟你握手的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.67,0:04:20.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That why your hand's against my crotch?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.67,0:04:20.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你的手抵住我的胯下？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.67,0:04:22.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- That is why. MIKE: Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.67,0:04:22.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 没错 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.05,0:04:26.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, Rach, where's Emma?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.05,0:04:26.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋，艾玛在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.26,0:04:27.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica made me send her to my mom's.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.26,0:04:27.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩妮卡逼我把她托我妈带
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.14,0:04:31.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Apparently, babies and weddings don't mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.14,0:04:31.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为小婴儿不适合参加婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.18,0:04:34.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you still crying about your damn baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.18,0:04:34.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还在为那死小鬼抱怨吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.27,0:04:39.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pheebs, you got to keep the line moving. Remember, 20 seconds per person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.27,0:04:39.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比，你要让队伍继续动 切记，一人二十秒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.19,0:04:40.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You see these clowns all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.19,0:04:40.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这些小丑，你每天都见得到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.49,0:04:47.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey, you're Mike's parents, right? - Yes, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.49,0:04:47.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你们是麦克的父母，对吧？ - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.87,0:04:50.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gosh, our little ones are growing up fast, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.87,0:04:50.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}孩子们长得真快，不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:53.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- How's that? - You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:53.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 什么意思？ - 你知道的…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.87,0:04:57.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...on one hand, you're happy for them. On the other, it's hard to let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.87,0:04:57.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然很替他们高兴 但要放手却也很难
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.29,0:05:00.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who in God's name are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.29,0:05:00.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你到底是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.38,0:05:05.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not that fond of you either, buddy. I'm just trying to be nice for the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.38,0:05:05.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也不是很喜欢你，老兄 我是看在孩子的份上给你面子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.09,0:05:12.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? We have no idea what we're doing in the wedding tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.09,0:05:12.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了，我们还不知道 明天在婚礼中要负责的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.85,0:05:15.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought we'd be groomsmen. They would have asked us by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.85,0:05:15.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们应该要当伴郎的 怎么还不跟我们说？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.89,0:05:18.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When did they ask you to be a bridesmaid?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.89,0:05:18.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们什么时候请你当伴娘的？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.60,0:05:22.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- November. - I wanna say it's not looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.60,0:05:22.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 11月 - 看来情况不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.07,0:05:24.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey, Pheebs? - Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.07,0:05:24.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 菲比？ - 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.07,0:05:28.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You haven't told these guys what they're doing in the wedding yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.07,0:05:28.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还没分配他们在婚礼的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.87,0:05:31.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, well, they're not in the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.87,0:05:31.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个…他们不必参与婚礼的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.62,0:05:33.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.62,0:05:33.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.21,0:05:38.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.21,0:05:38.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.25,0:05:41.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...this is really awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.25,0:05:41.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好尴尬
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.09,0:05:44.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, and I can leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.09,0:05:44.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了，我可以离开
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.42,0:05:49.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, you guys. But Mike's got his brother and his friends from school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.42,0:05:49.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉，两位，麦克有哥哥和同学
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.09,0:05:52.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, you know, you were...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.09,0:05:52.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你们…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.26,0:05:56.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If it helps, you were next in line. You just missed the cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.26,0:05:56.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其实，你们是备取 差一点就当成了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.89,0:05:58.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.89,0:05:58.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.39,0:06:01.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is like figure skating team all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.39,0:06:01.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这像是花式溜冰队的噩梦又重演了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.15,0:06:06.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, synchronized swimming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.15,0:06:06.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说水上芭蕾
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.74,0:06:09.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean... I mean, the balance beam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.74,0:06:09.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说…平衡木
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.91,0:06:11.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Help me. - Football.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.91,0:06:11.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 救救我 - 美式足球
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.41,0:06:13.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.41,0:06:13.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}威谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.53,0:06:15.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Pheebs, spit that out. That has pork in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.53,0:06:15.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比，快吐出来，里面有猪肉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.08,0:06:17.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.08,0:06:17.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦！哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.75,0:06:20.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought the pot stickers were supposed to be vegetarian?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.75,0:06:20.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为锅贴不是素食的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.71,0:06:23.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I changed them. I sent you a fax about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.71,0:06:23.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，我换掉了，我有传真通知你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.80,0:06:26.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't have a fax machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.80,0:06:26.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有传真机
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.63,0:06:29.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Huh. Well, then there are gonna be a few surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.63,0:06:29.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么接下来会有更多惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.26,0:06:35.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe we're gonna be the only people not in the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.26,0:06:35.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想不到我们是唯一 无法参与婚礼工作的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.60,0:06:39.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I know. I hate being left out of things. - And it's a wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.60,0:06:39.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我了解，我讨厌遭到冷落 - 更何况是婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.31,0:06:42.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It'll be weird if I'm not in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.31,0:06:42.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没份才真是诡异
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.31,0:06:46.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey, guys, how's it going? - Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.31,0:06:46.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 各位，你们好吗？ - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.32,0:06:51.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're sitting here, alone, doing nothing. It's our rehearsal for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.32,0:06:51.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们闲着没事坐在这儿 为明天要做的事彩排
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.82,0:06:54.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, about tomorrow, I've got a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.82,0:06:54.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着，关于明天我有件事要问你们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.45,0:06:57.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I found out one of my groomsmen had an emergency and can't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.45,0:06:57.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚发现 其中一个伴郎有急事不能来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.83,0:07:00.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What happened? - Who cares? And?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.83,0:07:00.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 出了什么事？ - 谁管他？然后呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.67,0:07:03.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I was wondering if one of you guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.67,0:07:03.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在想也许你们其中一个人…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.96,0:07:06.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'll do it! - Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.96,0:07:06.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我来 - 我要
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.00,0:07:09.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You both wanna do it? There's only room for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.00,0:07:09.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们都想当？可是只有一个空缺
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.72,0:07:12.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pick me. I look great in a tux, and I won't steal focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.72,0:07:12.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}选我，我穿礼服很师 但不会抢走你们的风采
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.51,0:07:16.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, Mike. No, no, you wanna pick me. I mean... Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.51,0:07:16.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不…麦克，应该选我，你瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.60,0:07:20.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.60,0:07:20.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}啊哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.85,0:07:25.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I really don't feel very comfortable making this decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.85,0:07:25.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得由我决定不太妥当
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.82,0:07:28.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, Phoebe knows you better. I'm gonna let her choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.82,0:07:28.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比跟你们比较熟，我请她选好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.74,0:07:35.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, if Phoebe's choosing, then say hello to Mike's next groomsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.74,0:07:35.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果让菲比选 那就见过麦克的新伴郎吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.83,0:07:38.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I will. But I will need a mirror...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.83,0:07:38.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然，可是我需要镜子…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.83,0:07:40.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...as he is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.83,0:07:40.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为就是在下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.12,0:07:45.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Please. You're going down. - You are going "downer."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.12,0:07:45.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 得了吧，你死定了 - 你才死透了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.79,0:07:47.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They say that on the figure skating team?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.79,0:07:47.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}花式溜冰队的人都这么说话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.88,0:07:50.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wouldn't know. I didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.88,0:07:50.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道，我根本没入选
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.55,0:07:56.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know I'm filling in for Phoebe's stepdad tomorrow, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.55,0:07:56.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道我明天要 代替菲比的继父吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.68,0:08:00.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yeah. Yeah. Hey, thanks for doing that. - Oh, hey, my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.68,0:08:00.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 对，感谢你的帮忙 - 我乐意之至
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.73,0:08:03.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what are your intentions with my Phoebe?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.73,0:08:03.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你对我的菲比有何意图？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.85,0:08:07.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I intend to marry her. - Oh, a wiseacre.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.85,0:08:07.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我意图娶她为妻 - 耍嘴皮子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.57,0:08:13.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I understand you plan to support your wife by playing the piano?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.57,0:08:13.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还听说你打算以弹钢琴维持家计？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.16,0:08:16.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Isn't that kind of unstable?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.16,0:08:16.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样收入不会不稳定吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.66,0:08:19.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No more so than acting. - Strike two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.66,0:08:19.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 应该比演戏好 - 两好球
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.58,0:08:23.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're right. She probably will support me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.58,0:08:23.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说得对，可能要她养我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:26.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, unless we move in with you, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:26.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不如搬去和你住吧？爸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.59,0:08:29.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Strike three.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.59,0:08:29.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}三好球
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.25,0:08:32.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You only get one more, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.25,0:08:32.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你只剩一次机会，麦克
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:38.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So? What did you decide?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:38.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你决定如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.30,0:08:40.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I decided to pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.30,0:08:40.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我决定去上厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.52,0:08:44.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have to choose one of us to be in your wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.52,0:08:44.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}麦克没跟你说吗？你得从我们之中 选出一个人参加婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.56,0:08:46.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- One of the groomsmen fell out. - Oh, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.56,0:08:46.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 有- 个伴郎不能来 - 不行…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.10,0:08:50.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't choose between you two. I love you both so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.10,0:08:50.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不能从你们俩选择，我爱你们俩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.90,0:08:54.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just not enough to put us in the original wedding party.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.90,0:08:54.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我们原本才不能参与婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.07,0:08:57.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I don't wanna choose. It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.07,0:08:57.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是我不想选，这…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.70,0:08:59.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Okay, wait. Rach? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.70,0:08:59.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 等等，瑞秋？ - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.74,0:09:03.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen, I have a very special bridesmaid task for you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.74,0:09:03.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着，我有个伴娘的特殊任务 要交给你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.45,0:09:05.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Goody! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.45,0:09:05.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了，是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.41,0:09:07.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, there's a spot open for only one groomsman...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.41,0:09:07.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在有一个伴郎的空缺
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:11.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and you have to choose between Ross and Chandler. So good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:11.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要从罗斯和钱德其中择一 祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.84,0:09:14.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? What, what, what? No, I don't wanna do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.84,0:09:14.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么…？我不想选
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.72,0:09:16.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess I have to find a new bridesmaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.72,0:09:16.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看来我得找新伴娘了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.80,0:09:18.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.80,0:09:18.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我来当
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.76,0:09:20.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, it's 2100 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.76,0:09:20.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在已经2 1 00了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.97,0:09:23.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Time for your toast. - Do I have time to go to the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.97,0:09:23.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 该敬酒了 - 我可以去上厕所吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.06,0:09:28.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You had a bathroom break at 2030. Pee on your own time, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.06,0:09:28.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在2030有上厕所时间 请遵守时问表，麦克
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.48,0:09:33.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In regards to the toasts, okay, you wanna keep them short.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.48,0:09:33.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}敬酒致词要简短
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.57,0:09:36.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing kills a rehearsal dinner like long speeches. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.57,0:09:36.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}冗长致词是晚餐彩排的一大杀手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.74,0:09:39.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You just get in, do your thing, and get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.74,0:09:39.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只要进去办完正事就出来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.24,0:09:40.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that what you say to Chandler?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.24,0:09:40.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你对钱德都这么说吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.74,0:09:45.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's 2101, and I am not amused.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.74,0:09:45.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}已经2 1 01了，我并不高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.87,0:09:48.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.87,0:09:48.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.62,0:09:52.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The bride and groom have a few words they'd like to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.62,0:09:52.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}新郎新娘有几句话要说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.46,0:09:56.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Hello, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.46,0:09:56.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位，大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.80,0:10:00.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And thank you all for being here tonight. So tomorrow's the big event.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.80,0:10:00.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}威谢各位今晚的到来 明天就是大喜之日了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:05.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Some of you might not know, but Mike and I didn't get off to the best start.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:05.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有些人也许不知道麦克和我 一开始并没有看对眼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.47,0:10:08.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. My friend Joey and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.47,0:10:08.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，我朋友乔伊和我…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.98,0:10:13.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...decided to fix each other up with friends. So I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.98,0:10:13.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}本来想替对方介绍对象，所以我…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.69,0:10:18.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, okay. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.69,0:10:18.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，我…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.36,0:10:21.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought about it, and I fixed him up with my friend Mary Ellen...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.36,0:10:21.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我把他介绍给我朋友玛莉艾伦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.70,0:10:25.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who couldn't be here tonight, because... It's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.70,0:10:25.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她今晚不克前来，因为…其实…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.66,0:10:28.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not important. Well, she's in rehab.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.66,0:10:28.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其实不重要，她人在戒毒中心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.91,0:10:33.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway. So Joey said that he was fixing me up with his friend Mike...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.91,0:10:33.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之，乔伊说要把他朋友 麦克介绍给我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.84,0:10:38.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...only he didn't have a friend Mike, so he just brought my Mike. And... And...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.84,0:10:38.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是他没有叫麦克的朋友 所以借用我的麦克
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.22,0:10:39.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CLEARS THROAT]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.22,0:10:39.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.05,0:10:43.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But despite, you know... It got good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.05,0:10:43.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但结果…却是好的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.35,0:10:48.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wanna take a moment to mention my mother, who couldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.35,0:10:48.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想趁此机会谈我无法到来的母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.02,0:10:50.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.02,0:10:50.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.94,0:10:53.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And... And moment's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.94,0:10:53.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}机会没了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.31,0:10:56.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So okay... Oh, no, forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.31,0:10:56.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好…这个跳过
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.48,0:10:58.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can forget that. Oh, this is funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.48,0:10:58.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这也跳过…这梱好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.74,0:11:02.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, but you need to know that to get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.74,0:11:02.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是要先说这个才听得懂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.45,0:11:05.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So... Oh, well, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.45,0:11:05.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么…好…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:07.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I... Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:07.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我…好…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.95,0:11:10.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, Monica, I can't do it like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.95,0:11:10.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩妮卡，我受不了了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.58,0:11:15.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is my wedding, okay? I don't want this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.58,0:11:15.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我的婚礼好吗？我不要这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.67,0:11:18.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or this... Or this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.67,0:11:18.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是这掴…还有这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.34,0:11:20.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay? I just wanted a simple wedding...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.34,0:11:20.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以吗？我只要一个简单的婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.76,0:11:24.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...where my fiancé can go to the bathroom any time he wants!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.76,0:11:24.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且我的未婚夫 随时想上厕所都可以！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.77,0:11:30.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You know what? You're done. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.77,0:11:30.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 算了，我不要你了 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.18,0:11:32.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're fired!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.18,0:11:32.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你被炒鱿′鱼了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.27,0:11:34.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.27,0:11:34.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干杯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.49,0:11:47.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey. - Happy wedding day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.49,0:11:47.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嘿 - 大喜之日快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.28,0:11:48.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Happy my wedding day to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.28,0:11:48.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}祝你我的大喜之日快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.58,0:11:52.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey, listen, this is gonna be bridesmaid central, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.58,0:11:52.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊，这里要当伴娘休息室
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.62,0:11:55.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're gonna have hair and makeup in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.62,0:11:55.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以厕所袒会有人梳发，上化妆品
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.21,0:11:58.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had to move a couple things in the fridge to make room for the corsages.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.21,0:11:58.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我空出冰箱一些空间放胸花
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.92,0:12:02.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Man! I wouldn't have had breakfast if I knew there was gonna be corsages.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.92,0:12:02.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可恶，早知道有胸花吃 我就不吃早赛了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.60,0:12:08.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.60,0:12:08.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.14,0:12:11.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}About last night...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.14,0:12:11.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}关于昨晚…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.64,0:12:14.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know you're under a lot of stress, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.64,0:12:14.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你压力很大…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.48,0:12:18.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, even though the things you said hurt me a little bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.48,0:12:18.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然你的话有点伤人…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.44,0:12:21.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My point is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.44,0:12:21.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的重点是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.11,0:12:24.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I'm willing to take my job back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.11,0:12:24.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我希望你让我继续工作
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.82,0:12:28.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, well, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.82,0:12:28.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.03,0:12:33.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think you and I will do much better if you're just here as a bridesmaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.03,0:12:33.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得你只当伴娘 你我会处得比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.33,0:12:37.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.33,0:12:37.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.38,0:12:38.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.38,0:12:38.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.88,0:12:41.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If that's really what you want, then here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.88,0:12:41.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}既然如此，拿去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.51,0:12:44.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I give you the headset. I don't really wanna give you the headset.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.51,0:12:44.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}耳机给你，但是我不想给你耳机
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.89,0:12:50.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess if you're taking over, then you should probably return these messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.89,0:12:50.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}既然你要自己处理 那就要回覆这些留言
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.56,0:12:52.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- This is a lot. - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.56,0:12:52.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.98,0:12:55.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I'm sure you can handle this. I have won awards...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.98,0:12:55.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我相信你可以应付 虽然我的组织能力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.02,0:12:59.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...for my organizational skills. But I'm sure you'll do fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.02,0:12:59.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}曾经得过奖，但我相信你应付得来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.36,0:13:02.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You've won awards? - I printed them out on my computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.36,0:13:02.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你得过奖？ - 我全都用电脑列印出来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.82,0:13:06.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.82,0:13:06.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嘿 - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.36,0:13:08.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Where's Rach? - She's in her room. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.36,0:13:08.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 瑞秋在哪？ - 房问里，怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.53,0:13:11.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have to talk to her about this groomsman situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.53,0:13:11.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要跟她谈伴郎的事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.20,0:13:14.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not gonna watch Chandler up there while I'm in the seats like some chump.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.20,0:13:14.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不要像呆瓜一样坐在那看着钱德
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:18.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.92,0:13:23.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My God, you're breathtaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.92,0:13:23.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老天啊，你真是明艳动人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.72,0:13:27.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.72,0:13:27.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.01,0:13:31.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You haven't by any chance chosen a groomsman yet, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.01,0:13:31.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不会已经选出伴郎人选了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.89,0:13:34.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, please don't make this harder than it already is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.89,0:13:34.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯，不要再给我压力了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.68,0:13:37.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not. I'm making it easier. Pick me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.68,0:13:37.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不会，我让你轻松点，选我就好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.44,0:13:41.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Chandler said it's important to him too. - Listen. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.44,0:13:41.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德也说这对他意义重大
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.23,0:13:45.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whoever you pick is gonna walk down the aisle with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.23,0:13:45.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听我说…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.44,0:13:45.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你选的人将会陪你走向走道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.03,0:13:49.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, I promise I won't say a word. But if you pick Chandler...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.03,0:13:49.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我保证不会说话 可是如果你选钱德
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.74,0:13:53.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...he's gonna be whispering stupid jokes in your ear the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.74,0:13:53.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他会不停在你耳边说冷笑话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.91,0:13:56.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you are the lesser of two evils.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.91,0:13:56.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}两个烂苹果，你比较不烂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.58,0:13:58.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.58,0:13:58.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.34,0:14:07.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sven, I don't understand what you're saying. What is wrong with the flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.34,0:14:07.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}史文，我听不懂你的话 你说花怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.42,0:14:09.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Lorkins"? What the hell are "lorkins"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.42,0:14:09.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝烂话〞？〝烂话〞到底是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.93,0:14:11.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.93,0:14:11.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.97,0:14:14.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey. - Mike, if you were Swedish...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.97,0:14:14.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你们好 - 麦克，如果你是瑞典人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.93,0:14:18.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and you were saying the word "lorkins," what flower would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.93,0:14:18.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后你说〝烂话〞 那会是什么花？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.94,0:14:20.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Orchids? - Right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.94,0:14:20.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 兰花？ - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.65,0:14:23.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's why I'm marrying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.65,0:14:23.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难怪我要嫁给你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.49,0:14:32.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.49,0:14:32.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好，麦克
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.91,0:14:34.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.91,0:14:34.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔瑟夫
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.25,0:14:38.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}May I have a word with you, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.25,0:14:38.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}借一步说话好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.63,0:14:50.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.63,0:14:50.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里真…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.63,0:14:52.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.63,0:14:52.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.14,0:14:54.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.14,0:14:54.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请坐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.81,0:14:59.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Last night...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.81,0:14:59.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}昨晚…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.27,0:15:03.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I tried to welcome you into my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.27,0:15:03.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我试着欢迎你加入我的家族
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.90,0:15:09.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And instead, you disrespect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.90,0:15:09.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}反之，你却不尊重我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:11.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I cannot allow this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:11.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}此举我绝不允许
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.41,0:15:15.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you rehearsing for some really bad Mafia movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.41,0:15:15.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在为一部烂黑帮电影彩排吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.49,0:15:18.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}More back talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.49,0:15:18.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又给我回嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.04,0:15:24.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And yes, I may be borrowing a few lines from my recent unsuccessful audition...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.04,0:15:24.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错，我的确引用最近 失败的试镜台词
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.63,0:15:28.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...for Family Honor 2: This A-Time It's A-Personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.63,0:15:28.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《家族荣耀2：打开天窗说亮话》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.55,0:15:33.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey, I kind of have a lot to do today. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.55,0:15:33.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊，我今天有点忙 你到底要说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.47,0:15:35.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I want you to take this seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.47,0:15:35.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要你认真看待此事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.80,0:15:38.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Phoebe is very, very important to me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.80,0:15:38.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比对我而官非常重要
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:41.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wanna make sure you are gonna take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:41.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要确定你能照顾她
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.31,0:15:45.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joe, I love Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.31,0:15:45.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊，我爱菲比
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.69,0:15:47.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's the most important thing in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.69,0:15:47.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她是我一生最重要的人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.03,0:15:51.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd die before I let anything happen to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.03,0:15:51.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我死也不会让她受伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.70,0:15:55.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's what I wanted to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.70,0:15:55.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这才是我想听的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.16,0:15:58.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because she's family, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.16,0:15:58.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为她是我的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.99,0:16:00.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And now you're gonna be family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.99,0:16:00.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在你也即将加入我们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.00,0:16:06.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And there's nothing more important in the whole world than family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.00,0:16:06.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}世界上最重要的莫过于家人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.38,0:16:08.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That must have been one lousy movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.38,0:16:08.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这部电影一定很糟
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.75,0:16:10.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That was me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.75,0:16:10.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我说的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.84,0:16:16.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hi. - Let's talk about this groomsman thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.84,0:16:16.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嗨 - 嘿，我可以跟你谈伴郎的事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.51,0:16:19.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you pick Ross, he'll walk you down the aisle just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.51,0:16:19.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你选罗斯的话 他会安然陪你走完走道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.56,0:16:21.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But if you choose me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.56,0:16:21.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是你选我的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.68,0:16:24.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you'll be getting some comedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.68,0:16:24.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就有笑话听了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.23,0:16:28.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.23,0:16:28.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.74,0:16:33.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I think I'm gonna pick Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.74,0:16:33.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我会选罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.11,0:16:35.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我告诉你该选我的原因Let me tell you why you need to pick me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.07,0:16:37.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.07,0:16:37.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.41,0:16:43.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, when I was a kid, you know, I was always left out of everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.41,0:16:43.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我小时候，总是受冷落
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.41,0:16:46.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and it really made me feel insecure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.41,0:16:46.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这让我很没有安全感
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.63,0:16:50.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was always picked last in gym...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.63,0:16:50.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}体育课总是没人要我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:54.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...even behind that fat exchange student who didn't know the rules to baseball.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:54.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}连那个不懂棒球规则的 胖交换学生都有人要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.93,0:16:58.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, this guy would strike out and then run to third.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.93,0:16:58.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那家伙被三振出局还往三垒跑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.02,0:17:03.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, if I'm the only one left out of this wedding...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.02,0:17:03.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之，如果我是唯一 无法参与婚礼的人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.14,0:17:08.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I just know that all those feelings are gonna come rushing back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.14,0:17:08.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那些不好的回忆一定又会涌上心头
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.61,0:17:12.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, fine, I pick you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.61,0:17:12.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，我选你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.82,0:17:14.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.82,0:17:14.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.28,0:17:18.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Make "groom" for Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.28,0:17:18.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伴郎钱德来也
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.04,0:17:23.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.04,0:17:23.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.33,0:17:29.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, we're gonna do it my way. Because your way is stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.33,0:17:29.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，照我的方式做 因为你的方式很蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:33.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, I got to go. I have another call, Reverend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:33.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，我得挂了 我还有电话，牧师
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.80,0:17:36.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.80,0:17:36.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.68,0:17:38.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'm glad we had this little talk. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.68,0:17:38.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 很高兴我们谈开了 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.93,0:17:41.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And thanks for all the wedding night advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.93,0:17:41.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你给我新婚之夜的指点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.97,0:17:44.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That didn't make me uncomfortable at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.97,0:17:44.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我听完成到很自在
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.60,0:17:46.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, so I'll see everybody tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.60,0:17:46.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，各位今晚见了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.06,0:17:48.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Okay. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.06,0:17:48.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好 - 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:56.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you guys know that there's a giant ice sculpture in the hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:56.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们知道走廊上有座大冰雕吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.65,0:17:58.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PHOEBE: Oh, my God, what's it doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.65,0:17:58.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊，怎么会出现在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.86,0:18:02.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess it got sent to the billing address as opposed to the shipping address.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.86,0:18:02.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看来他们把帐单地址 和送货地址搞混了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.16,0:18:07.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What a pickle. - Oh, my God, everything's such a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.16,0:18:07.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 真是糟糕啊 - 天啊，每件事都乱成- 团
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.62,0:18:10.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why is this happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.62,0:18:10.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么会发生在我身上？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:14.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How bad do you wanna stick your tongue on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:14.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真想用舌头舔那东西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.18,0:18:22.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- How's it going? ROSS: Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.18,0:18:22.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你好吗？ - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.72,0:18:27.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm just getting some coffee so I'm alert for the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.72,0:18:27.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我来买杯咖啡为婚礼待命
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.14,0:18:30.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's what I was doing too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.14,0:18:30.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.85,0:18:34.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, you have fun tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.85,0:18:34.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}祝你今晚险快
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.19,0:18:37.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You too. - Oh, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.19,0:18:37.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你也是 - 我- 定会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.19,0:18:38.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.19,0:18:38.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.70,0:18:46.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait a minute. I know why I'm being such an ass. Why are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.70,0:18:46.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等，我知道我践的原因 你在践什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.37,0:18:50.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'm not supposed to tell you. - I'm not supposed to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.37,0:18:50.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我不能告诉你 - 我也不能告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.50,0:18:54.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You told us both we could be in the wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.50,0:18:54.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你答应我们俩都可以参与婚礼？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.05,0:18:59.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In my defense, you weren't supposed to tell each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.05,0:18:59.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我铃须说，你们不该告诉对方才对
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.01,0:19:02.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rachel, only one of us can do it. You have to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.01,0:19:02.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋，只有一个空缺，你必须选择
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.93,0:19:05.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You and me together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.93,0:19:05.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你我再续前缘
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.72,0:19:08.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rach, Rach? Knock-knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.72,0:19:08.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋？敲敲门
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.77,0:19:10.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Who's there? - I'll tell you at the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.77,0:19:10.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 是谁？ - 等婚礼上再跟你说
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.94,0:19:14.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, I forgot my scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.94,0:19:14.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我忘记拿围巾
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.23,0:19:17.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't do this. I don't know which one of you guys to pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.23,0:19:17.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我做不来，我不知道要选谁
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.28,0:19:20.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you haven't picked yet? Oh, good, because I had an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.28,0:19:20.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还没决定吗？ 那好，我有个主意
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.57,0:19:25.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought it would be fun if the third groomsman was my family dog, Chappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.57,0:19:25.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果第三个伴郎由我家的狗 小胖担任会很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.78,0:19:29.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? A dog? No. Rachel gets to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.78,0:19:29.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？狗？不行，决定权在瑞秋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.75,0:19:32.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow, this is a tough one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.75,0:19:32.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是难以抉择
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.75,0:19:34.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think I'm gonna have to go with the dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.75,0:19:34.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我要选狗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.30,0:19:39.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what you're saying is that the chef is at the Hamilton Club...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.30,0:19:39.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等，你是说厨师已经到了俱乐部
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.09,0:19:44.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but the food is not? And the drinks are there but the bartender is not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.09,0:19:44.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是没食物？ 有饮料但酒保不见了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.39,0:19:47.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you freaking kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.39,0:19:47.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你开什么鬼玩笑？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.56,0:19:50.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.56,0:19:50.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.43,0:19:52.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Help me. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.43,0:19:52.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 救我 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.44,0:19:55.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I want you to be crazy bitch again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.44,0:19:55.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要你恢复疯婆娘的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.11,0:19:58.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.11,0:19:58.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.44,0:20:00.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.44,0:20:00.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.61,0:20:05.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You really want me to come back? - More than I wanna get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.61,0:20:05.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你真的要我回来？ - 比结婚还想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.83,0:20:11.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, people, we are back in business!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.83,0:20:11.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位，准备上工
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.33,0:20:15.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God, I have missed you so much. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.33,0:20:15.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊，宝贝，我真想念你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.25,0:20:18.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get your hair and makeup done. I'll take care of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.25,0:20:18.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你去梳妆，其他的我来处理
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.25,0:20:20.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey, what are you guys gonna do? - About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.25,0:20:20.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 各位，我们该怎么办？ - 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.09,0:20:23.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The blizzard. I just saw on the news...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.09,0:20:23.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}暴风雪，我刚刚看了新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.30,0:20:25.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...it's the worst snowstorm in 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.30,0:20:25.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是20年来最严重的大雪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.34,0:20:28.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They already closed all the bridges and tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.34,0:20:28.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}桥和隧道都关闭了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.81,0:20:32.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But the band and the photographer are coming in from New Jersey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.81,0:20:32.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是乐团和摄影师要从纽泽西赶来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.64,0:20:34.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't think they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.64,0:20:34.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看是不能来了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.98,0:20:38.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ha-ha! Looks like you're not gonna be in the wedding, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.98,0:20:38.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看来你也别想参加婚礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.65,0:20:41.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So sorry, Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.65,0:20:41.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很遗憾，菲比
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.29,0:20:57.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Well, the club lost its power. - The news said most of the city did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.29,0:20:57.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 俱乐部停电了 - 新闻说大部分地区都停电了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.71,0:21:00.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Since when do you watch the news? - For your information...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.71,0:21:00.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你何时闻始注意新板的？ - 让我告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.84,0:21:03.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...since they hired a very hot weather girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.84,0:21:03.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}自他们请到很辣的气象女主播开始
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.84,0:21:07.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe you aren't getting married today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.84,0:21:07.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真不敢相信你今天无法结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.34,0:21:09.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PHOEBE: I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.34,0:21:09.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.47,0:21:13.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's so beautiful out there. You always wanted to get married outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.47,0:21:13.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}外面好美 你不是一直很想在户外结婚？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.68,0:21:16.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Why don't you just do it on the street? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.68,0:21:16.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 干脆在街上举办婚礼 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.48,0:21:19.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, look, it's hardly snowing anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.48,0:21:19.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看，雪差不多停了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.36,0:21:22.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, you couldn't ask for a more romantic setting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.36,0:21:22.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这正好是最浪漫的场景
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.86,0:21:25.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This could be the simple wedding you've always wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.86,0:21:25.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也正好是你梦想中简单的婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.66,0:21:28.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.66,0:21:28.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.91,0:21:32.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think I wanna get married to you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.91,0:21:32.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想今天把你娶进门
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.25,0:21:38.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me too. Monica, do you think we could do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.25,0:21:38.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也是，摩妮卡，你觉得可行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.88,0:21:41.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Affirmative!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.88,0:21:41.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.18,0:21:51.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, let's get these chairs out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.18,0:21:51.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把椅子搬过来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.68,0:21:54.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gunther, hit the Christmas lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.68,0:21:54.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}阿甘，点亮圣诞灯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.27,0:22:00.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.27,0:22:00.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.23,0:22:06.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, who left the ice sculpture on the steam grate?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.23,0:22:06.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，是谁把冰雕放在蒸气口的？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.86,0:22:11.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. HANNIGAN: Michael. MIKE: Hey, you made it. Great. Chappy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.86,0:22:11.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 麦克 - 你们来了，太好了，小胖
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.83,0:22:14.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- There you go. MIKE: Hi. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.83,0:22:14.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 抱着 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.75,0:22:18.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know getting married in the street isn't what you approve of.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.75,0:22:18.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈，我知道在街上结婚你一定不认同
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.08,0:22:24.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, it's lovely. The lights and the snow. I could look at them forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.08,0:22:24.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，灯光和雪景很美 我看得爱不释手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.67,0:22:26.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I crushed a pill and put it in her drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.67,0:22:26.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在她的饮料里下了药
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.76,0:22:30.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.76,0:22:30.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来吧，甜′。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.43,0:22:34.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, Chappy's too small to handle all this snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.43,0:22:34.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小胖太小，在雪袒走不动
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.18,0:22:36.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Someone has to walk him down the aisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.18,0:22:36.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}必须有人带着他走
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.39,0:22:38.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Would this person be in the wedding? - I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.39,0:22:38.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 这个人可以算是参与婚礼？ - 应该算
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.10,0:22:40.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'll do it! - I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.10,0:22:40.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我来 - 我来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.81,0:22:44.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chandler, hello? I mean, aren't you scared of dogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.81,0:22:44.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德，拜托，你不是怕狗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.44,0:22:47.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not scared. I'll just take little Chappy and...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.44,0:22:47.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我才不怕，我只要带着小胖…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.49,0:22:50.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He can sense my fear! My throat is exposed!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.49,0:22:50.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他嗅得出我的恐惧 他咬得到我的脖子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.57,0:22:55.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I guess I'm in the wedding then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.57,0:22:55.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看来我能参加婚礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.91,0:22:58.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.91,0:22:58.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他好臭
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.83,0:23:01.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Level one alert! I repeat, level one, this is not a drill!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.83,0:23:01.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 一级警戒，重复，- 一级警戒 这不是演习
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.13,0:23:05.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We have a situation. The minister called. He's snowed in, he can't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.13,0:23:05.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}出状况了 牧师被困在雪中无法赶来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.88,0:23:07.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, no. - Hey, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.88,0:23:07.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 糟糕 - 别担心。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.96,0:23:10.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'm still ordained from your wedding. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.96,0:23:10.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我还保有牧师的身分 - 真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.34,0:23:14.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. You think I'd give up being a minister and pay to ride the subway?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.34,0:23:14.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会傻到放弃牧师 免费搭地铁的特权吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.26,0:23:17.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ministers don't ride the subway for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.26,0:23:17.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}牧师不能免费搭地铁
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.93,0:23:21.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had to read the Bible pretty carefully, but, yeah, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.93,0:23:21.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认真读过《圣经》，没错，我们免费
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.73,0:23:25.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We have to find someone else to walk Phoebe down the aisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.73,0:23:25.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，如果乔伊要主持婚礼 我们得找其他人陪菲比走走道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.73,0:23:27.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.73,0:23:27.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.53,0:23:30.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CHUCKLING]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.45,0:23:33.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, Mike and Joey, get in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.45,0:23:33.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，麦克和乔伊就定位
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.66,0:23:35.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chandler, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.66,0:23:35.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德，跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.58,0:23:46.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, Joey's doing the ceremony, and Chandler's giving you away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.58,0:23:46.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，乔伊要主持婚礼 由钱德陪你走
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.42,0:23:49.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, okay. Hi, new Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.42,0:23:49.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，你好，新爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.80,0:23:56.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- So you ready to do this? - Oh, my God. This is really happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.80,0:23:56.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}准备好了吗？
